#
# The fork's own: every text file is checked out with LF on every platform. A Windows checkout under
# Git's default autocrlf otherwise writes CRLF, which breaks the Docker builds (Dockerfile.builder's
# scripts, the codegen's drift check). Upstream has no .gitattributes.
* text=auto eol=lf
